# type(scope): subject          <- imperative, under 72 chars, no full stop
#
# type:  feat fix refactor perf test docs build ci chore
# scope: the area, not the file — expense balances group server outbox
#        cache icon ci — omitted when the change is not about one area
#
# Body only when the "why" would otherwise be lost. Wrap at 72.
# Never list changed files or restate the diff; git show does both.
